        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Surviving spouses of regular full-time and regular part-time employees on the active payroll as of December 31, 1994 will be eligible to receive cost of living adjustments on their pension benefit on an annual basis in accordance with the terms of the Michigan Consolidated Gas Company Retirement Plan for Employees Covered by Collective Bargaining Agreements. Surviving spouses of employees hired on or after January 1, 1995 are not eligible for cost of living adjustments on their pension benefit.",
